Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, Kori, Melissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brook
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.78,0:01:35.15,Ken's note,,0,0,0,,{\pos(317,233)}I have nothing to do with this world anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.78,0:01:35.15,Ken's note,,0,0,0,,{\pos(295,290)}Farewell, insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, the enemy of the planet, Koromon,\Nwas killed by the enemy of Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Koromon was the Skull Koromon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx115\fscy115\pos(321,329)}The Enemy is MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy was the MetalGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Agumon. I'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a few more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, integrate, quadratic?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like this stuff\Nmakes no sense. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit splashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so sorry, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't blame Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had an appointment for a haircut,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when I looked in the mirror,\NI realized my hair was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is, he was looking\Nin the mirror for over an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about Agumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have him make his own appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, if you're going to be\Na member of the Digidestined,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to have to think less\Nof your hair and more of the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's go and save Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where is Yoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's cleaning her glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As big as her glasses are,\Nthat could take hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When are people going to\Nlearn to wear goggles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll hurry up and go find\Nher so we can leave already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, we've been waiting for\Nyou to go to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to save Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And show that digital\Nemperor just who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you excited to\Ngo to the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us what's wrong so we can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see you're the\Nlast person I would ever
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,turn to if I was in trouble\Nand needed some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be nice, Tai. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just worried about Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want any of you\Nto put yourself in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you feel like you're\Nnot up to the challenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so maybe it would be best\Nif you stayed here, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone going if\Ntheir heart's not into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it'll make you\Nfeel any better, Yoli,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can stay and do my math\Nhomework just to keep yourself busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, my kendo\Nsticks could use some polishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right if I don't go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, you can make a day of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cleaning, math homework, and all\Nthose other fun things you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.33,0:04:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up a sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If everyone says you should\Nstay, then you should stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That someone's right, Yuli.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't feel like\Ngoing to the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I don't feel like going either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that that's finally\Nsettled, let's go get Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If everyone's ready, let's go,\NDigidestined! Digi-port open!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Rings keep failing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First there was Andromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then SkullGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a flaw with\Nit, but what could be wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just not powerful enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I can still experiment on Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to have the\Nwhole gang back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my treehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's not much of a treehouse\Nanymore since SkullGreymon disintegrated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's more of a twig house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.22,0:05:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was planning on redecorating anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't care about your\Nstupid tree, Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to stop the Digital\NEmperor from hurting more Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredibly important we stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he continues to gain power like this,\Nhe'll threaten the entire digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it, Cody. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but that can makes me so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carmodyllomon, you really\Nneed to control your temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.98,0:05:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the Digi-World are we going\Nto find out where Ogremon is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that Tentomon is out of his tree, maybe\Nwe can climb it and have a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And stay out of my tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:06:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai hasn't been this angry since I\Npopped his soccer ball with my claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He certainly has a right to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this standing around\Nis making my paws itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go see what I can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't touch my tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly how many\Npieces of bark are on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything will be okay, Tai. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon, the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon Dark Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon Dark Digimon to SkullGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Master, he's trying to escape,\Nand we just had those walls re-stuckoed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.77,0:06:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's overloading the Dark Ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must transfer more power to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't control Skull,\NGreymon He's too powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, wanna bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Master, let's just let him\Ngo Be quiet Greymon, don't digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't he ever listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, a control spire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one of the areas\Ncontrolled by the Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful, Flamethron!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flame shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm being defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to me, and who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Woodmon, do you know where\Nthe Digimon Emperor can be found?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not really sure,\Nbut I think he went that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, can I get a little help here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, pinch fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, I cleaned my glasses\Nfor the third time today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm still not happy. Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, guys, is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they probably don't want to talk\Nto me anymore after I let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's time I got tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, I missed a spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my information,\NAgumon can be found in Rail Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let them know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And tell them to stay out of my tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, you bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everybody okay, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon may have found Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:08:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me tell them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, just tell them about Rail Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once more...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foolish creature, you should\Nknow better than to fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you've given me what i\Nneed the dark ring can control
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an adult stage digimon but\Nnot a fully evolved digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it needs to be a different\Nshape like a cylinder or a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I know what I need to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have the time to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, look. We've made it.\NRail town. Rail town. Rail town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks more like grass and hill town to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon is in this town\Nsomewhere, so let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody split up and\Nstart looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Agumon escapes, Ken\Nwill have to use me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's going to be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bake him some brownies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark ring's gone. I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for a little payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This new structure will\Nincrease the power tenfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't even need the control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will ever be able to stop me\Nfrom taking over the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a dark ring, but a dark spiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:11:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this, I can control even\Na fully digivolved Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to test it on Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, Agumon's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm following his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are train tracks, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.18,0:11:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that noise? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.50,0:11:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's either the local or the express.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look who's driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's Agumon. Agumon! Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ought to slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a great big hug. Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Did he hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you were just\Nsqueezing my ribs too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, we should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:11:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Ken will come after Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:11:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all came here to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you want us to turn\Naround and go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I want to get back at the\Nguy who did this to Agumon, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you gotta learn, Davis,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that sometimes you gotta think with\Nyour head and not with your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're not at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Agumon's been through a lot, so our\Nfirst priority is to get him back to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we can come back\Nhere later and get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did Agumon get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An escape clause in his contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in no mood for humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, because I want to talk\Nto you about something serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that you\Ncould use me for your experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I am a Digimon just like Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can Digivolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say you can forget\Nabout it! But, Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please, I've done absolutely everything\Naround here you've asked me to do and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even cleaned that hair\Ntrap thing in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what kind of Digimon\Nwould you Digivolve into, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:13:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd transform yourself into a\Ngiant butterfly with scary-looking wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're about as useless\Nto me as an old pair of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,underwear that's made\Nout of 100 % poison ivy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And will you stop calling me Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is the Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm saying is, now that Agumon\Nhas escaped, I'm all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.22,0:13:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they've got Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a useful Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Ken, I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll have cookies and ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want mine with chocolate sprinkles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.24,0:13:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How endearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now you don't want\Nto be called Ken, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's Ken? Or Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't want to make me angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the one who put Agumon\Nin a cage like a wild animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You come down here now and\Ntake your medicine like a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do amuse me so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can defeat you just as\NI defeated Agumon. Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed of yourself, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the kind of bully that\Ngives bullies a bad name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're going to have to\Ndo better than that, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Aniline!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the word, Davis. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beemon! Armor! Digimon! Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let Fladramon have\Nall the fun, Cody. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, Armored Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.28,0:15:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Drill of Power! Digmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flaming Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock Cracking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tough. I'll save.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon, Armor Digivolve, to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nefertimon, the Angel of Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon flying home!\NDigimon! Rosetta! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Windmane!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you've come back to me, Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've got a new\Nfriendship bracelet for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are mine again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, are you okay? Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's being controlled again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Agumon, dark Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, dark Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.44,0:17:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.52,0:17:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks so different. And mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon's armor not\Nonly protects him from harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it conceals his\Ndestructive Gigablaster attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Spiral is working perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon is mine again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalGreymon, you've got to fight\Nthe Digimon Emperor's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, such a tense moment. I've got chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will he remember you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, he doesn't know who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nefertimon, help me stop MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden Noose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Metal, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.26,0:17:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what? Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got him trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon, can you get to the dark spiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't be a problem for old Digmon\Nif he just stops dancing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, we're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still too scared to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten how to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.42,0:18:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to break the golden noose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me just try to reach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing you'll reach is\Nthe bottom of his footprint, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.02,0:18:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giga Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the new Dark Spirals, I will\Ncontrol the whole digital world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Digi-fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And say goodbye to your\Npet, Agumon! Or good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.06,0:18:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.98,0:19:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the Dark Spirals in Meadow\NGreymon, I am invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.12,0:19:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meadow Greymon is the\Nmissing link I needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid is just begging\Nto be taking down a peg!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can we defeat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let Agumon down just when he\Nneeded me the most, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Yoli and Hawkmon! And Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about not coming\Nbefore. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd show up eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a good thing she did stay\Nor I never would have found you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you fill me in on\Nwhat's happened up until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it certainly sounds\Nlike you guys had a full day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault. Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you hitting Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And friends don't fight friends\Nunless they're on a boxing team,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's a whole different thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:19:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, let them be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. Huh? Thanks, Matt.\NI needed that. Sure, any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd really appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that I was just blaming myself for
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something that was\Ncompletely out of my control,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and also it doesn't help if I stand\Naround here and feel sorry for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now we need to focus on\Nhow we can get Agumon back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.98,0:20:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we have to be willing to\Nfight Agumon at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Agumon would\Ndefinitely rather be defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.30,0:20:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by us than remain a slave\Nto the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the future, when we\Nbattle the Digimon Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to be prepared to face\Nour friend Agumon as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I don't really know how to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, the next time you see\NAgumon, trash him, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeat Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.60,0:20:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe those words\Nactually came out of my mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's all go get Agumon back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never traveled by\Nsailing train car before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how all the\Nimportant people travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.74,0:21:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who put the sail in front of everything?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not the case.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at it. It's not the case.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give it a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't feel it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like a sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The feeling is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.62,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.62,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.86,0:22:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.39,0:22:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the new Digimental is called\Nthe V-MON, and the 2nd of the armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.86,0:22:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the next episode of Digimon\NAdventure, Aoi INAZUMA RIDE Leomon!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.81,0:23:00.31,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx125\fscy125\pos(320,330)}Blue Thunder, Lighdramon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:23:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the gate is open.

